                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hill to Mr. Powell.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-05-16"><hi rendition="#italic">May 16,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Hill states that the U. S. S. <hi rendition="#italic">Topeka</hi> sailed
                    from Port Royal, S. C., for Port au Prince on the morning of May 16.)</p>
            </div>
